        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, nuclear, at power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, nuclear, at power plant
Details on the two components average PWR and average BWR can be found in the respective US modules.;
UUID: 5c4ed618-d952-3a8e-a8d9-04f3927f12d6
The module represents the US nuclear mix (electricity delivered in 2006) of 66.5% PWR and 33.5% BWR.
Location: US data for PWRs and BWRs on radioactive emissions, efficiency, load factor, burnup, enrichment. Swiss data of one specific PWR and one specific BWR for other parameters, adapted.
Technology: Standard technology for commercial operation.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Energy statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c4ed618-d952-3a8e-a8d9-04f3927f12d6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
